              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The Standard bearer rides a warhorse and has a hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer. Characters’ warhorses may have cloth barding (+3) or (after 1450) full metal barding (+4).</characteristic>
