            <profile id="6476-68a3-acf3-0d62" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mounted Ministerialen ride horse and have hand weapon, light armour and shield. They may have thrusting spear (+3), and may exchange shield for light crossbow (+1). In late armies, they may have heavy armour (+1) and exchange shield for handgun (+3).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
