              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All mercenaries have the Unreliable rule. Mercenary Knights ride warhorses and have a hand weapon, heavy armour, lance and shield. First Charge. Shock Cavalry. In late armies, the warhorses may have cloth barding (+3).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
