              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">An artillery unit is made of one Cannon and 3 crew. You may add up to 3 additional crew for +10 each. The crew have a hand weapon and may have light armour (+2). The crew may be upgraded to Landsknechts that have WS3 and are Ld8 (+4 per crew).</characteristic>
